        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    full_employment_gdp = 1_300  # billions of dollars\n    actual_gdp = 1_200  # billions of dollars\n    mpc = 0.8\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    gdp_gap = full_employment_gdp - actual_gdp\n    fiscal_multiplier = 1 / (1 - mpc)\n    required_increase_in_government_expenditures = gdp_gap / fiscal_multiplier\n\n    # return answer\n    return required_increase_in_government_expenditures\n```",
